Possible product endpoint:

```
app.get("/products", async (req, res) => {
    try {
        const products = await getProducts();

        res.status(200).json(products);

    } catch (error) {
        res.status(500).json({
            message: "Server error"
        });
    }
});
```

This is an illustrative implementation pattern. Explain the actual database and AWS services you implemented in your project.

