Example of a simple carbon-estimation calculation:

```
electricity = 100emission_factor = 0.7carbon_emission = electricity * emission_factorprint(carbon_emission)
```

This is a simplified illustrative calculation. Actual emission factors must be selected according to the appropriate location, source and measurement units.

Example Pandas workflow:

